The seal SVG is a vector crop from the official blue "versione_01" UNIUD logo
made available by the University of Udine; its PDF is the runtime conversion.
The institutional footer SVG is likewise a vector crop from the same official
blue "versione_01" artwork and includes the UNIVERSITA DEGLI STUDI DI UDINE /
HIC SUNT FUTURA block; its PDF is used at runtime. The continuation UNI/UD mark
is generated typographically by the package and is not stored as an asset. The
HR/quality certification marks are taken from the official UNIUD letterhead
template (DOTX) available with the 2025/2026 visual identity material.

Official visual-identity files can be obtained from:
https://www.uniud.it/uniud/it/ateneo-uniud/identita-visiva/manuale_dimmagine/files

The included crop corresponds to the official files available on 2026-08-26,
the publication date of this package revision. If the University updates its
visual identity or source artwork, the current institutional files and rules
take precedence.

